{
  "statement_html": "<div class=\"encadre\">\t<div id=\"haut\"><div class=\"wimscenter\">\t<img src=\"/api/static/H4/algebra/oeffunctionmod.fr/images/robbie-maddison.png\" alt=\"Saut du canal de Corinthe\" /></div>\t</div>\t<p class=\"problematique\"> QUELLE EST LA HAUTEUR DU SAUT DE ROBBIE MADDISON ?</p>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"><a class=\"bouton\"  <span class=\"disabled_link oef_specialhelp\" data-help=\"sautrobbie\">Saut de Robbie Maddison</span></a></div>\t<div class=\"enonce\">La trajectoire du saut réalisé par Robbie Maddison est une courbe parabolique\t dont la fonction est définie par :\t<br />\t<div class=\"wimscenter\">\\(f{\\left(x \\right)}\\) = – 0,008x<sup>2</sup>+ 0,76x + 6 sur l'intervalle [ 0;100 ]</div> </div>\tAprès avoir regardé les vidéos, répondre aux différentes questions.\t<br /><br/>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"><a class=\"bouton\"  <span class=\"disabled_link oef_specialhelp\" data-help=\"videotableur\">Vidéo Open Office</span></a>\t<a class=\"bouton\"  <span class=\"disabled_link oef_specialhelp\" data-help=\"videogeogebra\">Vidéo GéoGébra</span></a>\t</div>\t<br />\t<div class=\"question\">\tCompléter le tableau de valeurs à l'aide d'un tableur <b>et</b> du logiciel libre GeoGebra.\t<div id=\"tab\">\t<table class=\"tab\" border=\"2\">\t<tr>\t<th>\\(x\\)</th>\t <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply3\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply5\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply6\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply7\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply8\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply9\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply10\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply11\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> </tr>\t<tr>\t<th>\\(f{\\left(x \\right)}\\) </th>\t <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply12\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply13\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply14\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply15\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply16\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply17\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply18\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply19\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply20\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply21\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> <td> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply22\" data-size=\"4\"></span></td> </tr>\t</table>\t</div>\t</div>\t</div>",
